{"seq":57,"slug":"elm-functional-frontend","title":"Elm 函数式前端语言","stage":"DONE","category":"languages","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend","rating":{"composite":3.69,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3,"positioning":null,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"elm-函数式前端语言\">Elm 函数式前端语言</h1><p>Elm 是一门专门为构建 Web 前端界面而生的纯函数式语言，它最激进也最被人记住的承诺只有一句：在实际项目中你几乎不会遇到运行时异常。它不是又一个编译成 JavaScript 的&quot;更好的 JS&quot;，而是把整套 Haskell 式的类型纪律、不可变性与受控副作用，重新裁剪成一个只关心&quot;如何安全地渲染界面&quot;的封闭世界。代价是它有自己的语言、自己的架构、自己的边界；回报是一旦编译通过，那种&quot;线上很难白屏崩溃&quot;的踏实感是大多数前端栈给不了的。</p>\n<p>这个 hub 按四条递进主线组织，对应四个章节。第一条是<strong>基础</strong>：Elm 在前端版图里的定位、它为什么坚持纯函数式、以及&quot;零运行时异常&quot;这个招牌承诺到底靠什么机制兑现（消灭 null、用 Maybe/Result 把失败建模成数据、编译器强制穷尽分支）。第二条是<strong>语言本身</strong>：自定义类型与类型别名如何表达领域、记录与不可变更新如何替代可变对象、管道 <code>|&gt;</code> 与柯里化如何让数据流读起来像一条流水线。第三条是 hub 的灵魂——<strong>Elm 架构（TEA）</strong>：Model-View-Update 这个被 Redux、Vuex、SwiftUI 反复借鉴的单向数据流，以及它如何用 Cmd/Sub 把所有副作用挡在纯核心之外，再用 Decoder 把不可信的外部 JSON 安全地搬进类型世界。第四条是<strong>实践</strong>：通过 ports 与既有 JS 生态共存、真实的工具链（elm-format / elm-test / elm-review）、以及最诚实的一节——什么时候<strong>不该</strong>选 Elm。</p>\n<p>四条主线是有依赖顺序的：理解&quot;零异常承诺&quot;之前要先接受纯函数式的取舍（章一）；读懂 TEA 之前要先会用自定义类型和记录建模（章二）；谈互操作与选型之前要先明白 TEA 的副作用边界在哪（章三）。建议初次接触者<strong>按章节顺序通读</strong>；有 React/Redux 背景的读者可以先跳到 <a href=\"architecture/elm-architecture-tea\">Elm 架构 TEA</a> 找熟悉感，再回头补章一的&quot;为什么&quot;；只想做技术选型的决策者可直接读 <a href=\"practice/elm-when-to-use\">选型与边界</a>，再按需回溯。</p>\n<p>本 hub 与几个兄弟 hub 有明确的分工边界，避免重复：纯函数、不可变、引用透明这些<strong>通用 FP 概念</strong>的本体定义在 <a href=\"../functional-programming/\">函数式编程</a> hub，本 hub 只讲它们在前端/Elm 语境下的具体形态；类型推断、代数数据类型、类型安全的<strong>普适理论</strong>在 <a href=\"../type-systems/\">类型系统</a> hub；Elm 的精神母语 <a href=\"../haskell-pure-functional/\">Haskell</a> hub 讲 typeclass、惰性、Monad 这些 Elm 刻意删掉的特性；而 <a href=\"../typescript/\">TypeScript</a> hub 代表&quot;渐进类型 + 务实&quot;的另一条前端路线，本 hub 多次以它作对照。涉及这些主题时，本 hub 一律一句话点到并链接过去，不展开。</p>\n<p>前置知识：读者应有 3 年左右的前端经验，熟悉 JavaScript、知道什么是组件状态与单向数据流；不要求懂 Haskell，但若有任何一门函数式语言的基础会让章二、章三轻松很多。读完整个 hub，你应该能判断 Elm 是否适合你的项目，并能读懂一个标准的 TEA 应用从 Model 到 view 再到 update 的完整闭环。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"why-elm","title":"为何 Elm","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend/foundations/why-elm"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pure-functional-frontend","title":"纯函数式前端","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend/foundations/pure-functional-frontend"},{"seq":3,"slug":"no-runtime-exceptions","title":"无运行时异常","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend/foundations/no-runtime-exceptions"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"language","title":"语言","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend/language","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"types-custom-types","title":"类型与自定义类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend/language/types-custom-types"},{"seq":2,"slug":"immutability-records","title":"不可变与记录","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend/language/immutability-records"},{"seq":3,"slug":"pipelines-currying","title":"管道与柯里化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend/language/pipelines-currying"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"architecture","title":"Elm 架构","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend/architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"elm-architecture-tea","title":"Elm 架构 TEA","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend/architecture/elm-architecture-tea"},{"seq":2,"slug":"commands-subscriptions","title":"命令与订阅","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend/architecture/commands-subscriptions"},{"seq":3,"slug":"json-decoders","title":"JSON 解码器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend/architecture/json-decoders"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"practice","title":"实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"javascript-interop","title":"与 JS 互操作 (ports)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend/practice/javascript-interop"},{"seq":2,"slug":"elm-ecosystem","title":"生态与工具","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend/practice/elm-ecosystem"},{"seq":3,"slug":"elm-when-to-use","title":"选型与边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/elm-functional-frontend/practice/elm-when-to-use"}]}]}